    "created_at": "2025-03-19T18:46:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-19T18:46:45Z",
    "body": "Hmm, this seems imprecise. 4.1.1 is irrelevant. The parsing requirements for `Set-Cookie` are detailed in https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-ietf-httpbis-rfc6265bis#section-5.6 (The Set-Cookie Header Field).\n\nThat suggests to me that `a b = c d` ends up as a cookie whose name is `a b` (one 0x20 in the middle) and value is `c d` (one 0x20 in the middle) and rejecting 0x20 outright would not be what we want.",
